1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,132
¡Mira nomás

2
00:00:01,132 --> 00:00:02,550
qué esponjositos!

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,198
¡Hoy hacemos panqueques

4
00:00:05,198 --> 00:00:06,050
de plátano!

5
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,519
Necesitas un plátano

6
00:00:07,519 --> 00:00:08,350
bien maduro,

7
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,350
dos huevitos,

8
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,680
y media taza

9
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,550
de avena.

10
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,050
¡Primero machacamos

11
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:14,950
el plátano!

12
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,284
Luego agregamos

13
00:00:16,284 --> 00:00:17,350
los huevitos.

14
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,550
Después, la avena.

15
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,866
¡Y mezclamos,

16
00:00:20,866 --> 00:00:22,550
mezclamos, mezclamos!

17
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,325
Ahora, al sartén

18
00:00:24,325 --> 00:00:25,950
con mantequillita.

19
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,215
Cuando salgan

20
00:00:27,215 --> 00:00:28,950
burbujitas, ¡volteamos!

21
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,098
Y al final,

22
00:00:30,098 --> 00:00:31,318
¡miel y canela!

23
00:00:31,318 --> 00:00:32,150
¡Qué rico!

24
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,116
¡Comenta qué receta

25
00:00:34,116 --> 00:00:35,233
quieres que

26
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:36,350
haga Michi!
